# specs/approved/type-values.md: whole-case todo. Upstream: a defined function name cannot be used as a value (E_FUNCTION_NOT_VALUE); see specs/approved/named-function-values.md.
todo test "Different refinements are not equated merely by their base"
  def positive(n :: Rational) n > 0
  def nonZero(n :: Rational) n != 0
  a = RefinementType(Rational, positive)
  b = RefinementType(Rational, nonZero)
  assert a != b
  assert a != Rational
end
